OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court backs family's
OL,4,Aacquittal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA High Court judge has granted the
OL,7,Ffamily of a man who was stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in a nightclub permission to
OL,9,Fchallenge the Director of Public
OL,10,FProsecutions' decision not to apply to
OL,11,Fthe Court of Appeal to overturn the
OL,12,Facquittal of a man in connection with
OL,13,Fthe killing.
OL,15,FRyan Passey, 24, died from a single
OL,16,Fstab wound at Chicago's nightclub in
OL,17,FStourbridge on 6 August 2017. The man
OL,18,Ftried for murder was cleared by a jury
OL,19,Fin 2018. A subsequent civil case ruled
OL,20,Fthat Passey had been unlawfully killed.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
