OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court backs family's
OL,4,Aacquittal challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judicial review was brought by the
OL,7,Fgroup Justice for Ryan and heard in
OL,8,FBirmingham on Tuesday. They campaigned
OL,9,Ffor a fresh examination of the case.
OL,11,FEmotions ran high in court, with tears
OL,12,Fvisible in the public gallery after the
OL,13,Fjudge granted a full hearing.
